    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MATCH APP! is a visual novel game based on a Japanese dating app. Players take on the role of the protagonist and experience a story of new encounters through the dating app.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist, <strong>Masayan</strong>, is a university senior about to graduate. Encouraged by his friend <strong>Hiroshi</strong>, Masayan decides to dive into the world of dating apps. For the shy Masayan, everything is a first experience, and he's constantly confused... Will Masayan be able to &quot;match&quot; with a woman?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Masayan (CV: Ryutaro Ohno)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist of the story. A university senior who has never had a proper romantic relationship during his college life. He starts using a matchmaking app at Hiroshi\u2019s suggestion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hiroshi (CV:Uriela Cugui)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Masayan\u2019s roommate and friend. One day, he recommends a dating app to Masayan and supports him in his romantic journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kumoko (CV: Kaede Takekawa)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A woman who matched with Masayan on the app. Although she doesn\u2019t have much dating experience, she takes a very proactive approach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Information</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtime: 1 hour-2 hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Voice (Japanese Voice)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 CGs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Content Warning</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains the following:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Depictions of Criminal Acts:</strong> The story includes depictions of specific criminal acts such as theft and fraud, as well as related situations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Violent Content:</strong> The game features violent situations and expressions, including physical altercations and fights.</p></li></ul>",
